# Pawpatch Formation, "Draw a card. Create a Food token." The third mode has no target, so it can be chosen with nothing for
# the other modes to aim at (Bot2 has no creatures or enchantments). Bot1 draws the top card of its library (an Island) and
# gets an untapped Food token, a colorless artifact, under its control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Pawpatch Formation
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island x2
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Pawpatch Formation.Cast
Bot1.Modes(3)
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest; Mox Emerald; Food Token
Bot1.Battlefield.Food Token.Token = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Food Token.Tapped = false
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
Bot1.Library.Count = 11
Bot1.Graveyard = Pawpatch Formation
